[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0018","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4273","title":"Ppfeufer 2 Click Social Media Buttons WordPress 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"2 Click Social Media Buttons WordPress 插件 0.34 版本之前的 libs/xing.php 文件中存在跨站脚本漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 xing-url 参数注入恶意的 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码触发该漏洞，导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行。该漏洞影响启用该插件的 WordPress 网站，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者无需认证即可实施攻击，需诱使用户访问特制链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4273"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-13T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:44:45Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress 插件 2 Click Social Media Buttons 至 0.34 或更高版本，该版本已修复 xing-url 参数未正确过滤导致的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台暂时禁用该插件，并检查主题或功能中是否硬编码了相关短代码调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/112615/WordPress-2-Click-Socialmedia-Buttons-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?old_path=%2F2-click-socialmedia-buttons&old=532798&new_path=%2F2-click-socialmedia-buttons&new=532798","http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/2-click-socialmedia-buttons/changelog/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75518","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4273.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4273.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4273.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-4273.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4273.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2012-4273-2195.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2012-4273.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2012-4273-2196.yaml","https://github.com/thompson005/nuclei-scanner/blob/6b5cfd844640c882a3d278f76f395a74ee14ef81/nucleivault/pro%20template/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4273.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2012-4273-2196.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4273_1.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0013","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2371","title":"Mnt-tech WP-FaceThumb WordPress 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 WP-FaceThumb 插件 0.1 版本中的 index.php 文件存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 pagination_wp_facethumb 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或用户访问特制链接时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2371"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-13T20:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:41:26Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 WP-FaceThumb 0.1 插件，该插件已长期未维护且无安全补丁。如必须使用，在主题 functions.php 中对 pagination_wp_facethumb 参数添加 esc_attr() 转义处理，或安装 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence）拦截恶意请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/112658/WordPress-WP-FaceThumb-Gallery-0.1-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49143","http://wordpress.org/support/topic/plugin-wp-facethumb-reflected-xss-vulnerability-cwe-79","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/15/12","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/16/1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53497","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37155","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2371.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-2371.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2371.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-2371.js","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2371.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2371.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2012-2371-2177.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-2371_1.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2012-2371-2175.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2012-2371-2175.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2012-2371-768a12a075bfd3e1bc707162b718c0d5.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0017","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4253","title":"MySQLDumper 多个目录遍历漏洞","description":"MySQLDumper 1.24.4 存在多处目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 learn/cubemail/install.php 的 language 参数或 learn/cubemail/filemanagement.php 的 f 参数注入 `../` 路径遍历序列，可读取服务器上的任意文件；或向 learn/cubemail/menu.php 的 config 参数注入 `../` 序列，可执行任意本地文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入路径进行充分过滤，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4253"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-13T18:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:44:42Z","remediation":"由于 MySQLDumper 1.24.4 已无官方维护且无后续版本修复，建议手动修改受影响 PHP 文件：在 learn/cubemail/install.php 中对 language 参数、learn/cubemail/filemanagement.php 中对 f 参数、learn/cubemail/menu.php 中对 config 参数，添加 basename() 或 realpath() 路径过滤，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列。同时通过 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）或 WAF 添加规则，拦截包含 ../ 及空字节编码的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/112304/MySQLDumper-1.24.4-LFI-XSS-CSRF-Code-Execution-Traversal.html","http://www.osvdb.org/81609","http://www.osvdb.org/81615","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53306","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75283","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75286","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37129","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4253.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4253.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4253.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-4253.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/422db14aea6c90ec23ceb3c50e97ae16c76d143d/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-42xx/CVE-2012-4253.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2012-4253.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4253_34.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/05/Reports/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/v1asdcv/DDDD-/blob/26176d9f6a7e7eb9d549f38939cba88b9e54e63f/common/config/workflow.yaml","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/NVD/data/2012.csv","https://github.com/jmoraissec/openasm/blob/f3b38a4502d7a16b760f8965b2b5a9e94d3a914d/nuclei-templates/infra/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4253.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0258","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0258.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2857","title":"Google Chrome CSS DOM释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 21.0.1180.57之前版本（Mac OS X/Linux）及21.0.1180.60之前版本（Windows/Chrome Frame）的CSS DOM实现中存在释放后使用（Use-after-free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过特制文档触发已释放内存的访问，导致拒绝服务或可能造成其他未明影响。该漏洞源于CSS样式表处理过程中对对象生命周期的错误管理，影响Chrome、Safari及iTunes等使用WebKit的应用程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2857"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-06T15:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:13Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2012-00001\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2012-2857\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"Google Chrome CSS DOM 释放后重用漏洞\"\ndescription = \"Google Chrome 21.0.1180.57（Mac/Linux）及 21.0.1180.60（Windows/Chrome Frame）之前版本的 CSS DOM 实现中存在释放后重用漏洞。远程攻击者可通过特制文档触发已释放内存的访问，导致拒绝服务，或可能造成其他未指明的影响（如任意代码执行）。攻击条件为诱导用户访问恶意构造的网页。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 6.8\nsources = [\"cve\", \"avd\", \"tenable\"]\npublished = \"2012-08-06\"\nupdated = \"2024-11-20\"\nremediation = \"升级 Google Chrome 至 21.0.1180.57（Mac/Linux）或 21.0.1180.60（Windows/Chrome Frame）及以上版本。Apple Safari 用户需升级至 6.0.3，iTunes 用户需升级至 11.0.3 以修复此漏洞。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=136235\", \"http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/07/stable-channel-release.html\", \"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Jan/msg00000.html\", \"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Mar/msg00003.html\", \"http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5642\", \"https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15336\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_u