":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0258.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0257","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2847","title":"Google Chrome 过多下载未提示资源消耗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 21.0.1180.57（Mac OS X/Linux）及 21.0.1180.60（Windows/Chrome Frame）之前版本存在资源管理错误漏洞（CWE-399）。当用户访问恶意构造的网站时，浏览器不会对大量连续下载操作弹出确认提示，导致攻击者可诱导用户触发大量自动下载，从而耗尽系统存储和网络带宽资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互配合，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2847"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-06T15:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:12Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 21.0.1180.60（Windows/Chrome Frame）或 21.0.1180.57（Mac/Linux）及以上版本，该版本已修复大量下载未提示问题，在连续下载前会弹出用户确认对话框。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用自动下载功能或通过组策略限制下载行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=127522","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/07/stable-channel-release.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15735","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2847.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2012/CVE-2012-2847.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2847","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2847","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2012/CVE-2012-2847.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2847","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2847","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2847.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2847.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2012-2847.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0323","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3646","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器所采用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，在用户使用 Safari 浏览器访问时触发内存损坏，导致应用程序崩溃或远程执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Safari 6.0 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制内容发起利用。Apple 已在 Safari 6.0 版本中修复此漏洞，用户应升级至最新版本以确保安全。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3646"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:38Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 到 6.0 或更高版本。对于 OS X Lion 用户，请安装 Safari 6 更新（需 OS X Lion v10.7.4），可通过 Mac App Store 或系统偏好设置中的软件更新功能获取。如暂时无法升级，建议避免访问不可信网站，并考虑暂时改用其他浏览器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3646.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3646","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3646.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/bl