 Lion 用户安装 Safari 6.0 后续安全更新），iOS 设备升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，应避免访问不可信网站，并考虑通过防火墙或代理过滤恶意网页内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3644","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3644.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3644.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2012/CVE-2012-3644.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0321.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0319","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3642","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页触发该漏洞，导致应用程序内存损坏并引发崩溃，进而可执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 和 iOS 系统上的 Safari 浏览器，攻击者无需身份认证，只需诱导用户访问包含恶意特制内容的网页即可完成利用。由于 WebKit 被广泛应用于 Safari 及 iOS 系统，影响范围较广。Apple 已在 iOS 6.0 和 Safari 6.0 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3642"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:38Z","remediation":"升级 Safari 浏览器至 6.0 或更高版本。对于 OS X Mountain Lion 用户，请前往 App Store 下载 Safari 6.0 更新；对于 Lion 或 Snow Leopard 用户，可运行系统软件更新或从 Apple 官网下载独立安装包。如暂时无法升级，建议临时禁用 WebKit 的 JavaScript 自动执行功能并谨慎点击未知来源链接，以降低远程代码执行风险。建议立即安装 Apple 2012 年 7 月 25 日发布的安全更新 (APPLE-SA-2012-07-25-1)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3642","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3642.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3642.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2012/CVE-2012-3642.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0319.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0318","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3641","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari浏览器所采用的WebKit渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119），远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意内容的特制网站触发该漏洞，导致目标系统发生内存损坏并执行任意代码或引发应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响Safari 6.0之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度为中等，攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意网页作为攻击条件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3641"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:38Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple Safari 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 WebKit 内存破坏漏洞。对于 macOS Lion 和 Mountain Lion 系统，可通过 Mac App Store 免费获取 Safari 6.0；Windows 用户需下载 Safari 6.0 for Windows 安装包。如暂时无法升级，应避免访问不受信任的网站，禁用 JavaScript 执行（Safari → 偏好设置 → 安全 → 取消勾选\"启用 JavaScript\"），并启用\"安全浏览\"功能以阻止恶意网站。同时建议将系统更新至最新版本以获取其他相关安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3641.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3641","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2