可在用户系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。Apple 已在 Safari 6.0 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3639"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:38Z","remediation":"将 Apple Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 或更高版本；Mac OS X Lion 用户安装 2012 年 7 月 25 日发布的 OS X Lion 10.7.4 安全更新（内含 Safari 6.0），Mountain Lion 用户升级至 10.8 或后续版本；iOS 设备将系统升级至 6.0。如无法立即升级，可在 Safari 偏好设置 → 安全性中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不受信任的网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3639","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3639.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3639.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2012/CVE-2012-3639.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0315","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3638","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，影响 Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本及依赖 WebKit 的应用程序。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，在用户使用受影响浏览器访问时触发内存越界读写，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱导目标用户打开恶意链接即可完成利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Apple 已在 Safari 6.0 及后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3638"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Mac 系统上的 Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 或更高版本，Windows 系统上的 iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本，iOS 设备升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本，以修复 WebKit 引擎中的内存破坏漏洞。如无法立即升级，请避免使用旧版 Safari 或 iTunes 访问不受信任的网站，并启用防火墙限制出站连接，直至完成补丁安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3638","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3638.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3638.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2012/CVE-2012-3638.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0314","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3637","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器所采用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，影响 Safari 6.0 之前版本以及 Apple iOS 6.0 之前版本。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网站向目标用户发送特制 Web 内容，触发 WebKit 在处理网页渲染过程中的内存损坏，最终实现任意代码执行或导致浏览器应用程序崩溃。该漏洞利用无需身份认证，攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意链接即可完成攻击，受影响范围包括桌面端 Safari 浏览器及移动端 iOS 设备。Apple 已在 iOS 6.0 和 Safari 6.0 安全更新中修复此漏洞，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3637"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:37Z","remediation":"Mac OS X 用户应立即升级 Safari 至 6.0 版本（需运行 OS X Lion v10.7.4 或更高版本），或安装 Apple 2012 年 7 月 25 日发布的安全更新（Safari 6.0 for Lion），该版本通过改进 WebKit 内存管理机制修复了多处内存破坏漏洞。iOS 用户应将设备升级至 iOS 6.0，覆盖设备包括 iPhone 3GS 及后续机型、iPod touch（第 4 代）及后续机型、iPad 2 及后续机型，iOS 6.0 同样通过改进 WebKit 内存处理消除了该漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在 Safari 中禁用 JavaScript 执行并避免访问不受信任的网站，以降低远程代码执行风险。此外，Windows 用户应升级 Safari 至 6.0（通过 iTunes 10.7 或直接下载 Safari 6 for Windows）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3637","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3637.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3637.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2012/CVE-2012-3637.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0313","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3636","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签内的内容。<value>Apple Safari 6.0 及更早版本中使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意构造的网页，利用该漏洞执行任意代码或导致应用崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞与 TIFF、PNG、JPEG 图像及 ImageIO 的内存处理错误有关。成功利用需用户交互，攻击条件为中等复杂度。受影响范围包括桌面版 Safari 以及运行 iOS 6.0 之前的 iPhone、iPad 和 iPod touch 设备。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3636"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:37Z","remediation":"Mac 用户请将 Safari 升级至 6.0 或更高版本：OS X Lion 10.7.4 用户可通过 Mac App Store 或系统偏好设置中的软件更新功能免费获取 Safari 6.0；OS X Mountain Lion 及以上版本用户直接通过系统更新安装。iOS 用户需通过 iTunes 将设备升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。Windows 用户请将 iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本以获取 WebKit 安全修复。如暂无法升级，建议暂时使用其他浏览器并避免访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施。详细修复信息可参考 Apple 安全公告 APPLE-SA-2012-07-25-1 及知识库文章 HT5400、HT5485、HT5503。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3636","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3636.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3636.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2012/CVE-2012-3636.json"]